WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.439
Open Reports and inspect the available formats.

00:00:01.439 --> 00:00:03.502
Choose a document report and inspect the study-guide template.

00:00:03.502 --> 00:00:06.261
Generate a Study Guide with practice questions and a glossary.

00:00:06.261 --> 00:00:09.630
Open the generated Study Guide and inspect its chapter-based structure.

00:00:09.630 --> 00:00:11.988
Inspect the report’s export options for Docs and Sheets.
